    "body": "Cause, from the log of run 45144581204 and a code read (not reproduced yet):\n\n- The panic is at `crates/ui/tests/catalog_render.rs:119`: `rough-finish kept as it is: its linked file model/rough-finish.obj cannot be read (No such file or directory (os error 2))`.\n- `3d/rough-finish` (PR #3668) is the only catalog project that links an external model file with a relative path.\n- The link watch of the UI (`crates/ui/src/model_link_watch.rs:71,95`) reads the relative path against the working directory of the process, not against the folder of the project file.\n- This is a defect of the application also: a user who opens such a project from a different working directory gets the same message.\n\nPlan: resolve a relative link path against the folder of the open project, with a pinning test. The effort label goes from `effort:low` to `effort:medium`: the fix is logic in one module, not a mechanical edit.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
